# This repo is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, which would otherwise hand
# Spotless CRLF files while .editorconfig asks for LF — every line of every file then reads
# as a violation. Pinning eol here overrides autocrlf and makes git, Spotless and ktlint
# agree. Spotless reads these attributes directly (its default lineEndings is GIT_ATTRIBUTES).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf

*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.keystore binary
